SUMMARY:Downtown Tampa Craft Festival
LOCATION:Cotanchobee Fort Brooke Park 601 Old Water Street Tampa \, FL 336
 02 United States
DESCRIPTION:This exciting new festival will take place at Cotanchobee Fort
  Brooke Park in downtown Tampa. This scenic waterfront park offers a lovel
 y green space situated along Garrison Channel\, directly between the Tampa
  Bay History Center and the Hillsborough River. Cotanchobee Fort Brooke Pa
 rk serves as is an oasis of serenity in downtown Tampa area. The festival 
 features handmade arts and crafts as well as a green market area\, offerin
 g a diverse range of hand-picked goods and eco-friendly products to peruse
  and purchase. About the Festival When: Saturday\, October 31st\, 2026 10:
 00am to 5:00pm Sunday\, November 1st\, 2026 10:00am to 5:00pm Where: 601 W
 ater Street in Tampa\, FL (https:www.google.commapssearch60120Water20Stree
 tTampa33602FLUS) Cost: Free Admission \n\nPermalink: https://www.tampa.gov
 /node/196516
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.tampa.gov/node/196516
END:VEVENT
